-- theory-maturity: COMPLIANCE of the theory-layer maturity axis — each object's `maturity:` frontmatter (`SEED | grounded | load-bearing`) must match the rule re-derived from its own body (load-bearing iff in README § Load-bearing objects; grounded iff a canonical `## Evidence` entry plus a non-stub `## What it is`; else SEED), with a both-directions cross-check between the README Load-bearing list and the declared `maturity: load-bearing` set. Intrinsic-only: reciprocal-edge completeness is deliberately NOT consulted (that relational axis is owned by theory-coherence). Advisory v1, advisory until proven quiet-when-clean on the Phase 1 backfill
+- theory-maturity: COMPLIANCE of the theory-layer maturity axis — each object's `maturity:` frontmatter (`SEED | grounded | load-bearing`) must match the rule re-derived from its own body (load-bearing iff in README § Load-bearing objects; grounded iff it has at least one typed `## Relations` edge plus a non-stub primary definitional section; else SEED), with a both-directions cross-check between the README Load-bearing list and the declared `maturity: load-bearing` set. Intrinsic-only: reciprocal-edge completeness and empirical evidence presence are deliberately NOT consulted (those axes are owned by theory-coherence and surprise-independence). Advisory v1, advisory until proven quiet-when-clean on the Phase 1 backfill
 - seed-backlog: INVENTORY of the seed compression-clock — parses every `## Live Seeds` entry's `review: <date>` token (deposit+28d) and reports AGED seeds (review date past, prune candidates) plus MISSING-REVIEW seeds (incomplete backfill / clockless new seed). The theory-layer instance of the wake model; exits 0 always, STAYS advisory (an attention surface, never a commit gate)
 - generation-event-closure: COMPLIANCE that generative references close — each generative reference (`internal-cross-read`, `internal-seed-forest`, `cross-model-collision`, `human-theory-collision`) must carry `status: open | closed`, and `status: closed` requires its paired `## Integrator assessment` (or the `## TL;DR`+numbered collision shape) section. Reports `status: open` references as unclosed deposits (P5 paired-genre rule). Non-generative references (dr-reports, syntheses) are exempt. Advisory v1, advisory until proven quiet-when-clean
 - theory-reflexive-balance: INVENTORY of the strange-loop density — for each `grounded`+ object, indexes whether the body declares an `external-transport: <system>` (an external system the theory moves to) or carries an explicit honest `reflexive-only` mark, or is `unmarked`, and reports the layer-wide transport-declared-vs-reflexive ratio. Observational only; the `## Transport predictions` decoder section does NOT count (that is internal validity). Exits 0 always, STAYS advisory and NEVER gates — the strange loop is the program's thesis, so density is made visible, not capped; reflexive-balance is externally-adjudicable-only per `explanation-blind-spot-duality`
